  "body": "Resource optimization on top of stable e30490b.\n\n- classify trusted Vinted /items/... URLs explicitly\n- extend existing headless image/media blocking from catalog pages to item-detail pages\n- preserve all document/script/xhr/stylesheet traffic\n- keep challenge/CAPTCHA assets allowed\n- keep login, inbox, session-refresh and non-Vinted/lookalike hosts outside optimization\n- add regression coverage for item pages and challenge exceptions\n\nNo scheduler, session, negotiation decision, quota, backend or frontend behavior is changed.",
